    "Comparator U103, its dividers and feedback are grouped above the input protection stage; C114 provides a dedicated same-face 100 nF bypass.",
    "The bypass supply trace is 1.791 mm and its ground trace to a ground via is 1.800 mm. These lengths do not qualify total loop inductance.",
    "Q103, R120 and R121 are regrouped below U101. The final shutdown ground via is clear of AUX return regions.",
    "All 14 native regions are contiguous; all prior groups and AUX GND-land split-return topology are preserved. The first candidate is rejected for an unintended ground merge.",
    "The 22 selected new surface route projections and the inner reference path have adjacent ground coverage except their own signal-via antipads. Other source, output, gate and RUN reference gaps are explicitly recorded for follow-up.",
